; ==============================================================================
; FILE: projects/albums/the-paper-wall/2003-eleventh-child-book-1/2003-eleventh-child-book-1.rsip
; ALBUM EDITION: The Eleventh Child, Book 1 - System.Crash (The Paper Wall)
; LAYOUT: 640x480 16:9 OpenGraph CD-Autorun Micro-Installer (Per-User Vault)
